[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11400.79, "timestamp": "03:10:00", "text": "请支持我出道的理由等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11402.389, "timestamp": "03:10:02", "text": "当然，如果你是位新晋 YouTuber，那就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11404.79, "timestamp": "03:10:04", "text": "不要花钱，好吗？以及所有的一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11406.95, "timestamp": "03:10:06", "text": "你可以直接使用免费模型，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11409.19, "timestamp": "03:10:09", "text": "当然是它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11411.59, "timestamp": "03:10:11", "text": "以及我拥有的这些模型和所有东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11414.95, "timestamp": "03:10:14", "text": "我一直在用的这些东西都像是礼物一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11418.63, "timestamp": "03:10:18", "text": "好心人，还有我从未付过钱的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11420.79, "timestamp": "03:10:20", "text": "或者其他任何东西，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11423.59, "timestamp": "03:10:23", "text": "但同时我也想投入更多。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11426.389, "timestamp": "03:10:26", "text": "我想在力所能及的领域投入更多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11429.349, "timestamp": "03:10:29", "text": "提供给你们。我想给予"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11431.91, "timestamp": "03:10:31", "text": "品质好的东西。我想给予美好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11433.429, "timestamp": "03:10:33", "text": "事物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11437.429, "timestamp": "03:10:37", "text": "这样我的梦想就能实现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11447.19, "timestamp": "03:10:47", "text": "所以，嗯，为此我将做我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11449.91, "timestamp": "03:10:49", "text": "最难的是，我想证明给自己看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11452.95, "timestamp": "03:10:52", "text": "并向所有认为我值得的人表达我的感激之情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11455.59, "timestamp": "03:10:55", "text": "所以这意味着我将打破这个规则。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11459.91, "timestamp": "03:10:59", "text": "我已经建好了舒适外壳，对吧？"}]